  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21527260",
      "title": "Which Problem Does The Composition API Solve?",
      "lectureOrder": 286,
      "videoOrder": 254,
      "sourceHash": "c81e704e17ccd3d5c928cde5081bcdbd5cc19d24d0a5f0757eefa406803e1772",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.24,
          "end": 6.07,
          "en": "What exactly is the Composition API?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.07,
          "end": 10.08,
          "en": "Well, let's start with what we learned thus far.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.08,
          "end": 13.76,
          "en": "When it comes to building Vue apps and Vue components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.76,
          "end": 18.76,
          "en": "we thus far used the so-called Options API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.04,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "We created this configuration object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 26.27,
          "en": "and in there we configured various options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 26.27,
          "end": 28.55,
          "en": "for example, the data option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.55,
          "end": 33.55,
          "en": "the methods option, but maybe also computed or watchers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.29,
          "end": 36.85,
          "en": "So we had this configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 36.85,
          "end": 40.07,
          "en": "where we set up our data, our methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 40.07,
          "end": 42.21,
          "en": "So to code, we could run up on events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 44.6,
          "en": "for example, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.6,
          "end": 46.82,
          "en": "And I will emphasize that again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.82,
          "end": 50.9,
          "en": "this approach is absolutely fine and you can stick to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.9,
          "end": 54.91,
          "en": "It's not bad, it's not a second best option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.91,
          "end": 57.06,
          "en": "It is absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.06,
          "end": 60.09,
          "en": "And knowing it is actually a requirement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.09,
          "end": 63.573,
          "en": "for understanding the Composition API, I would say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.69,
          "end": 67.1,
          "en": "But what is the Composition API then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.1,
          "end": 69.22,
          "en": "This is the Options API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.22,
          "end": 72.97,
          "en": "The Composition API is an alternative way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.97,
          "end": 76.34,
          "en": "of writing the logic behind our components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.34,
          "end": 80.1,
          "en": "And it was introduced because we might,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 85.1,
          "en": "and I'm saying might, face two main limitations or issues",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.15,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "when building bigger Vue apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 91.74,
          "en": "In smaller and medium-sized apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.74,
          "end": 95.11,
          "en": "we will very likely never face those issues,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.11,
          "end": 98.43,
          "en": "but in bigger apps, we might face them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.43,
          "end": 101.22,
          "en": "Issue number one is that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.22,
          "end": 103.46000000000001,
          "en": "that belongs together logically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.46000000000001,
          "end": 107,
          "en": "is actually split up across multiple options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107,
          "end": 110.41,
          "en": "data, methods, computed, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.41,
          "end": 112.95,
          "en": "And I have a little example project here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.95,
          "end": 114.75999999999999,
          "en": "You don't find it attached here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.75999999999999,
          "end": 116.67,
          "en": "because we're not going to work with it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.67,
          "end": 118.82,
          "en": "I just want to show it to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.82,
          "end": 120.9,
          "en": "Now, in this demo app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.9,
          "end": 122.95,
          "en": "which brings this to the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.95,
          "end": 125.47,
          "en": "where we can sort various users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.47,
          "end": 130.47,
          "en": "filter for users, and view the projects of our users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.5,
          "end": 133.38,
          "en": "and also filter those projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.38,
          "end": 136.76,
          "en": "in this app, I'm using a couple of different components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.76,
          "end": 140.24,
          "en": "which together form this user interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.24,
          "end": 143.73,
          "en": "And this app is built with the features we learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.73,
          "end": 146.64,
          "en": "over the last modules in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 150.11,
          "en": "In all those components, I'm managing data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.11,
          "end": 152.12,
          "en": "I might be getting some props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.12,
          "end": 155.44,
          "en": "I might be registering more local components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.44,
          "end": 157.4,
          "en": "We get some computed properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.4,
          "end": 159.48,
          "en": "some methods, some watchers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.48,
          "end": 162.42000000000002,
          "en": "And that's not just the case in this one component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.42000000000002,
          "end": 164.493,
          "en": "but in multiple components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.9,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "Now, coming back to that first problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 170.28300000000002,
          "en": "I brought up here, that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.28300000000002,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "that might belong together logically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 176.29,
          "en": "is split up across data methods and computed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.29,
          "end": 178.91,
          "en": "so across these different options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.91,
          "end": 183.18,
          "en": "That's something we can see in this demo application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.18,
          "end": 186.1,
          "en": "In the user list component here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.1,
          "end": 189.64,
          "en": "I have some data that is related to searching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.64,
          "end": 192.833,
          "en": "and other data that is related to sorting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 194.27,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "I got a computed property that deals with searching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 199.503,
          "en": "and then one that deals with sorting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.87,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "I got a method that deals with searching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 204.94,
          "en": "one that deals with sorting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.94,
          "end": 208.07999999999998,
          "en": "Got a watcher that deals with searching and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 211.8,
          "en": "And that's what I meant with features that belong together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.8,
          "end": 214.77,
          "en": "are split across these different options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.77,
          "end": 217.38,
          "en": "Now, this is definitely not a horrible problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 221.47,
          "en": "and this is definitely not a super huge application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.47,
          "end": 223.25,
          "en": "but it is an application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.25,
          "end": 226.77,
          "en": "where this component already could become",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.77,
          "end": 228.56,
          "en": "a bit annoying to manage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.56,
          "end": 231.3,
          "en": "Because if you change something about searching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.3,
          "end": 233.71,
          "en": "you might have to change it here in data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.71,
          "end": 236.64,
          "en": "then change something here in the computed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.64,
          "end": 238.25,
          "en": "change something here in methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.25,
          "end": 240.22,
          "en": "And you have to scroll around a lot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.22,
          "end": 242.22,
          "en": "and find the different pieces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 245.7,
          "en": "that together make up the search feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 245.7,
          "end": 247.37,
          "en": "because the different pieces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 247.37,
          "end": 251.453,
          "en": "that make up that feature are split across various options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.4,
          "end": 255.84,
          "en": "But that's not just the only issue we could be facing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.84,
          "end": 258.753,
          "en": "with the current way of building Vue apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259.77,
          "end": 262.78,
          "en": "In addition to the problem I just described,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 262.78,
          "end": 265.58,
          "en": "re-using logic across components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.58,
          "end": 268.07,
          "en": "can also be tricky or cumbersome.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.07,
          "end": 271.24,
          "en": "Now, I will say there are ways of reusing logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.24,
          "end": 275.053,
          "en": "but they all have their downsides and might not be ideal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 276.34000000000003,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "And in this demo app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.47,
          "end": 279.62,
          "en": "there is logic that could be re-used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 279.62,
          "end": 281.23,
          "en": "Both in the user list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.23,
          "end": 283.34000000000003,
          "en": "as well in the projects list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.34000000000003,
          "end": 286.35,
          "en": "I have my search functionality.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 286.35,
          "end": 291.35,
          "en": "And I have similar computed properties and similar watchers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.23,
          "en": "And it would be nice if we could reuse some logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 295.23,
          "end": 299.21,
          "en": "so that we don't have to write almost the same code twice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.21,
          "end": 301.61,
          "en": "in two different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 301.61,
          "end": 304.7,
          "en": "Well, and these are the problems we could be facing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 304.7,
          "end": 309.1,
          "en": "in bigger Vue applications with the current approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 309.1,
          "end": 313.3,
          "en": "Not technical problems and maybe not problems at all to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 313.3,
          "end": 315.87,
          "en": "maybe you're absolutely fine with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.87,
          "end": 319.043,
          "en": "but maybe things you would like to get rid of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 320.64,
          "end": 325.313,
          "en": "And that's exactly where the Composition API can help us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 326.25,
          "end": 328.51,
          "en": "Instead of writing code like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.51,
          "end": 332.52,
          "en": "where we split our logic across multiple options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 332.52,
          "end": 337.06,
          "en": "that's all the white, this API is called the Options API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 337.06,
          "end": 341.54,
          "en": "we instead bundle our logic in a new setup method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 341.54,
          "end": 344.89,
          "en": "which we add to our component config object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 344.89,
          "end": 347.95,
          "en": "The setup method is added next to data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.95,
          "end": 349.65,
          "en": "and methods, and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.65,
          "end": 353.6,
          "en": "but it will actually replace data methods and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 353.6,
          "end": 355.5,
          "en": "And we will manage our data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 355.5,
          "end": 358.05,
          "en": "our functions, our computed properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 358.05,
          "end": 361.77,
          "en": "and our watchers in that set up method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.77,
          "end": 365.11,
          "en": "where we then also expose them to the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 365.11,
          "end": 368.25,
          "en": "so that we can interact with those things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368.25,
          "end": 369.84,
          "en": "And that's, by the way, important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 369.84,
          "end": 371.76,
          "en": "The template code you write,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 371.76,
          "end": 374.43,
          "en": "features like VF, and data binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.43,
          "end": 378.48,
          "en": "and all of that stays exactly the way you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 378.48,
          "end": 382.26,
          "en": "It's just how we set up our code in this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 382.26,
          "end": 384.54,
          "en": "in this component, conflict object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 384.54,
          "end": 386.52,
          "en": "That is what will change a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.52,
          "end": 389.73,
          "en": "when you switch to the Composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.73,
          "end": 392.1,
          "en": "Because we're going to merge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.1,
          "end": 396.54,
          "en": "you could say these four main options, data methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 396.54,
          "end": 400.43,
          "en": "computed, and watch, into this setup method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.43,
          "end": 402.92,
          "en": "But with that, we got enough theory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 402.92,
          "end": 405.21,
          "en": "Let's now dig into the code and see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 405.21,
          "end": 408.593,
          "en": "how we actually get started with the Composition API.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
